the **first-turn trajectory** — not from keeping\nthe tool surface smal"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"l forever. This preset keeps Minimal's brain and gives it\nStandard's hands."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"1. The session's **first user message** picks the anchor:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Task | Persona | First-request tools |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| **spec** — fix / maintain / debug | Minimal's exact prompt | `bash` + `read` + `edit` |\n| **react*"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"* — build / create from zero | hands-on doer prompt | `bash` + `read` + `write` |\n| **weak** — ambig"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"uous | model self-picks (Pro: classify instruction) | `bash` + `read` |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`glob`/`grep` stay out of every bootstrap catalog — measured trajectory\nboundary for V4 Pro; `edit`/"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"`write` are anchor-safe.\n2. On request #1 the persona is the ONLY prompt section and runtime context"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"s\nare cleared — the cleanest possible opening.\n3. After the session records its first durable `tool/"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"call`, every later\nrequest sees the full Standard catalog; the chosen persona stays constant\nand the"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" remaining sections (plan-mode etc.) return. Nothing is injected\nafter turn one (measured: post-anch"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"or guidance hurts Pro)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Mode and promotion state live in durable session events, so refresh and\nresume preserve them."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Option A — installer bundle (recommended)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Restart DeepSeek Harness. The bundle copies the preset into\n`$DSH_HOME/.agent-presets/anchored-stand"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ard/` (idempotent — local edits are\nnever overwritten), then create a blank session and select\n**Anc"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"hored Standard (experimental)**. To make it the default preset for new\nsessions:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Option B — manual preset directory"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Export the session JSONL and inspect `request/header` events — the first\nheader contains only `bash/"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"read`, every later header the full catalog:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## What you get vs what you give up"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| | You get | Trade-off |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| vs Minimal | 23 more tools: glob/grep/edit/write/web_search/subagents/workflows/skills/goals/todo…"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" | one extra reasoning round for the bootstrap |\n| vs Standard | task-matched trajectory anchors (98"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"/99 vs 91/92 in the reference eval) + a first turn that is cleaner than Standard's | the first-reque"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"st catalog is decided by keyword classification — ambiguous tasks fall back to the weak anchor and l"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"ed by keyword classification — ambiguous tasks fall back to the weak anchor and let the model pick |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Evidence & honest boundaries"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Mechanism (task-matched bootstrap catalog → full catalog) is verified on\nharness `0.1.0-rc.6` at t"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"he wire level; the classifier and anchor tables are\nunit-tested.\n- The 98/99 ability scores are `xia"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"obright/modeltest` Project2 V4.1b — **n=2\non one frozen task**. They are reproducible evidence for t"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"hat task, not a\nuniversal guarantee across models or workloads. The spec/react/weak anchor\ndesign in"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"corporates measured findings from\n`yjh051108/dsh-router-standard` (P1-P24) and xiaobright's trajecto"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"ry\nboundary probes.\n- V4 Flash does not need this: it generalizes across harnesses (style changes,\ns"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"cores don't). This preset targets **Pro** with `reasoningEffort: max`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Developed and verified against DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6`. The harness is a\ndeveloper preview wit"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"h breaking changes — review upstream changes before\nupgrading."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Community & license"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"This is a community project: not an official DeepSeek preset, not affiliated\nwith or endorsed by Dee"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"pSeek. Design inspired by\n`xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard`\n(see NOTICE). MIT — LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

